{"sourceUrl":"https://www.iie.ac.cn/xsjy/zxtz/202606/t20260612_8227807.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:40.331207+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.iie.ac.cn/xsjy/zxtz/202606/t20260612_8227807.html","html":"<div><div><p><span><span><span><span>中国科学院信息工程研究所（以下简称“信工所”）是</span></span></span></span><span><span>2011</span></span><span><span><span><span>年批准成立的中国科学院直属科研机构。目前拥有网络空间安全防御重点实验室、信息内容安全国家工程研究中心等一批国家级和省部级的科研创新平台。主要研究方向包括：密码理论与技术、体系结构安全、数据安全、信息内容分析、信息对抗、智能认知安全、电磁与工控安全、高等级系统安全、网络威胁分析、网络空间安全评测等。信工所在册研究生</span></span></span></span><span><span>1900</span></span><span><span><span><span>余人，导师近</span></span></span></span><span><span>300</span></span><span><span><span><span>人。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>信工所将于</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月举办“网络空间安全技术”全国优秀大学生夏令营。本次夏令营活动旨在为广大优秀学子提供近距离接触科学研究的机会，</span></span><span><span>诚邀全国各地网络空间安全、计算机、通信工程、软件工程、人工智能、电子、数学及相关专业的优秀本科生</span></span><span><span>参加。现将相关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、申请条件</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱科学事业，品德良好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>全国高校网络空间安全、计算机科学与技术、通信工程、软件工程、人工智能、电子科学与技术、数学及相关专业</span></span></span></span><span><span>2023</span></span><span><span><span><span>级本科生（即</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生）。</span></span><span><span>不接受跨专业且零基础报名</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>本科阶段学习成绩优异，科研潜力突出，具备较强的调查研究、分析及解决问题能力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>通过国家大学英语四级或六级考试，具备良好的英语听、说、读、写综合应用能力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二、报名时间及流程</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名流程：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>登录</span></span><span><span><strong>中国科学院大学夏令营报名系统</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span>http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/sc</span></span><span><span><span><span>，注册后进入申请系统进行信息填报，培养单位请选择“信息工程研究所”。请确保所填本人手机号码、邮箱真实、常用，以便顺利接收后续通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>填报时请仔细阅读系统首页的“填报说明”和“常见问题解答”。</strong></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>填写完成后的申请表无需下载打印，仅供系统审核使用；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>如多次填报，最终审核以申请号码最大的一次为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>信工所将根据申请人填报信息进行严格筛选，并于</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>初</span></span></span><span><span>采用邮件方式通知通过资格审核的申请人入营，未通过资格审核的将不再另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>报名阶段仅做系统信息填报。</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、活动时间及内容</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、活动时间：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>线上开营活动：</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日，以在线直播形式进行，全体入营营员均须参加。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>线下参观交流活动：分两个批次，营员可根据自身情况任选一批次来所参加。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>第一批次：</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>第二批次：</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>如时间有变化，以最</span></span></span><span><span>新通知为准。</span></span><span><span><span><span>无法来所参加线下活动的营员，可关注并参与后续线上活动</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p><ol start=\"2\"><li><span><span><span><span>活动内容</span></span></span></span></li></ol><p><span><span><span><span>信工所将开展丰富多彩的活动，让优秀学子们了解信工所，活动包括开营仪式、科学家专题报告、科研成果展示、科研实验互动、导师座谈会、优秀学长见面会等。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>四、材料提交要求</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>经审核通过并正式通知入营的同学，届时需要提交以下</span></span><span><span>材料，请提前准备，提交时间和方式以入营邮件通知为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、身份证复印件、学生证每页复印件。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名表（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>，填写至个人自述部分，手填、打印均可，需学生本人、班主任（辅导员）签字 。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、政审表（附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>，手填、打印均可），需所在院系党总支或学生处签字盖章。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单），加盖学校教务处公章；专业排名证明，尽量提供。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>、个人简历（包含但不限于个人基本信息、学业情况、学习经历、社会实践经历、获奖情况、爱好和特长等内容）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>、其他证明材料，如大学期间的获奖证书、外语水平证明材料、发表的学术论文及专业学习情况介绍等，可自愿提交。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>材料按序整理好后放在档案袋中，袋上写明“</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营</span></span></span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span><span><span>姓名”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>五、注意事项</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、报名材料须真实有效，不得弄虚作假。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、夏令营名额有限，被邀请入营后确定不来参加夏令营的，请及时通知我们，以便为其他学生提供宝贵机会。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、参加夏令营的学员须严格按照日程安排进行学习和活动。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>六、联系方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系部门：中国科学院信息工程研究所学生教育处</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></span></span><span><span>010-82345089</span></span><span><span><span><span>（孙老师）</span></span></span></span><span><span>, zhaosheng@iie.ac.cn</span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>通信地址：北京市海淀区树村路</span></span></span></span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span><span><span>号</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>学生教育处 </span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.iie.ac.cn/xsjy/zxtz/202606/t20260612_8227807.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><div title=\"footer\"><p><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.iie.ac.cn/xsjy/zxtz/202606/W020260612460630344331_ORIGIN.gif\"/></span><span></span></p><p><br/></p><br/><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div><p></p><p><br/></p></div></div>","textSha256":"b8ff10a7643b1e6c61e687466cba98f356448c1ed9a9a890e8504a356f4dc950","textLength":1709,"sourceSha256":"e5c6a57c93845f81fb6c455a0be310910603e0d77f074247678334080632a6e2","selector":"article-like:about-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c71902925a2d1d62a1c1","title":"2026年中国科学院信息工程研究所2026年“网络空间安全技术”全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:40.331207+00:00"}
